9388,597,Data Analyst II,Utilimarc,United States,"Job Description

WHO IS UTILIMARC...

Utilimarc is on a mission to bring better data driven decisions to every fleet. We build SaaS products and provide the analytical power to achieve this. We are a team of strategists, analysts and technologists- focused on interpreting data and turning it into actionable insights for our customers. The cornerstone of our business is analytics.

WHY WE NEED YOU:

Utilimarc is a small and nimble team made up of the most passionate people. We’re acting to add a Data Analyst II to the mix. You will be responsible for assisting and supporting our clients with our Business Intelligence products. You will be focused on delivery of BI data and analytics and also serve as a client assigned primary analyst.

JOB DUTIES:
• Develop and maintain BI reports by translating functional requirements into easy-to-use, flexible reporting solutions and dashboards.
• Educate and train clients to use the data as an analytical tool, displaying the information in new forms and content for the purpose of analysis.
