• Compiles & distributes data for information needed, such as, but not limited to, the weekly and monthly company dashboard & statistic reports
• Help train users to learn basic report functions of the various practice management data systems to allow users to capture and enter information, run standard reports, create and run their own reports as necessary and ensure consistent and uniform data collection and data entry practices.
• Develop and maintain practice management information reports, analyzing critical metrics and benchmarks across all health l centers, including monthly patient encounter statistics and monthly Ahlers CVR visit data; provide, and develop where necessary, reports required by relevant organizations, including New York State, and other government agencies. Work with each department to provide critical data to help meet all affiliate goals.
• Manages the data collections, and reporting such as, but not limited to the monthly reports, and the annual ARMS AASC Report
