• Serve on affiliate work groups, committees and task forces.
• Remain abreast of trends and developments in the field of practice management and reporting. Non-Essential Functions:
• Participate in relevant company and practice management software User groups.
• Regularly checks personal company email account for important affiliate-related communications, at least every 24 hours.

Qualifications: Experience, Education and Licensure
