• Establishing relationships at Semiconductor to improve communications between the remote office and HQ
• Preparing for and participating in ongoing meetings, focused on collaboration with Sales and Operations to formulate strategies and action plans
• Development of Analytic package that can be distributed to our Executives & Account Executives

REQUIREMENTS FOR DATA ANALYST
• College students in their junior/senior year
• Proficient experience with MS Word, Excel, Power point
• Good with numbers and data

PERKS & BENEFITS:-
• Health & wellness (health insurance, Dental, Vision, Medical, Life Insurance)
• Financial & Savings (401K Plan, HSA, HCFSA)
• Perks & Bonuses (Charitable Matching Gifts, Tuition Assistance, Fitness Benefits, commuter benefits)
