PLEASE NOTE CONTRACTORS ARE ENGAGED TO PROVIDE SERVICES TO OUR CLIENT ON A CONTRACT BASIS IN CONNECTION WITH A SPECIFIC ASSIGNMENT. CONTRACTORS ARE HIRED AND EMPLOYED THROUGH ZENEX PARTNERS AS THEIR W2 WORKING AT THE CLIENT-SIDE. WE WILL PROVIDE MEDICAL BENEFITS ALONG WITH PAID SICK LEAVES. ZENEX PARTNERS BELIEVE IN BUILDING DIVERSE & INCLUSIVE PRODUCTS FOR OUR CLIENT. AS A TEAM, ZENEX PARTNERS FOCUS ON A DRIVE FOR RESULTS THAT IS WIN-WIN AND 100% UNIQUELY TAILORED TO GET THE BEST TALENT FOR OUR CLIENTS.

