100% Remote position...

Responsibilities for the Cyber Security Data Analyst

• Support security information and event management (SIEM)/security orchestration, automation, and response (SOAR) efforts and log aggregation technologies to ensure data is ingested, normalized, parsed, and prepared for analysis.

