Produce reporting of data analysis findings to management to aide in business decisions

Special Projects as needed throughout CRMLS

Qualifications:

To perform this job successfully, an individual must be able to execute each essential task in a superior manner. The knowledge, skills, and abilities specified in this job description are representative of those required. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential duties and responsibilities of the position.

