Requirements:

This position requires good understanding of MLS operations and technologies. Must be able to interact with end users who may be under stress requiring understanding and a calm handling of issues. Basic understanding of application development and database concepts are required. Extensive understanding of IP network troubleshooting, browser-based applications and the Windows desktop environment are required. Ability to write and communicate clearly and effectively. May be required to lift and/or move objects up to 25 pounds. Position requires sitting and standing for extended periods of time.

