• Develop and prepare information products for associated staff and members. * Responsible for ongoing analysis of health care information, obtained from a variety of sources, including patient care, financial, and demographic data. * Works with the Governed Reporting System (GRS) team to create information rich reports utilizing the operation data store or data warehouse and providing statistical verification of results.
