9683,892,Associate Consultant - Data Analysis (Kansas City Metro Area Only),"SES, Inc.","Shawnee, KS","SES is looking for a Data Analyst with a mastery of applying Excel and R software to analyze data. Additional experience with Life Cycle Analysis projects and SimaPro software puts your resume on the top of the list. Strong technical writing and verbal communication skills are a must. _ This job is open to candidates in the Kansas City Metro and surrounding areas. _

The ideal candidate has... intellectual curiosity, loves to learn, and understands the balance between sustainability and real-world needs. We are looking for a team player who enjoys participating in a company culture that is based on objective science and diverse thinking and problem-solving. The right person will thrive best working autonomously and enjoys the dynamic of a small but growing company.

