9846,1055,REMOTE Data Analysts (Analytics/ETL),"Atrilogy Solutions Group, Inc.","Kansas City, MO","Our direct client is looking to hire TWO ""Data Analysts"" for their Data Analytics Team for a ""direct hire/perm"" role.
