9995,1204,"Analytics Manager, Sales & Operations",Harnham US,United States,"Analytics Manager, Sales & Operations

Los Angeles, CA (US Remote Eligible...

$140-155k base + bonus

This is a great opportunity to join a leading broker of customer acquisition services as an Analytics Manager. The company helps clients grow through in-person marketing and sales campaigns.

The Analytics Manager would play a key role in their growing Financial and Business Analytics team, reporting directly to their VP of Financial Planning & Analytics. You will be responsible for leading sales operations analytics for multiple marketing campaigns.

ROLE OVERVIEW - ANALYTICS MANAGER, SALES & OPERATIONS
• Manage complex campaigns with multiple clients from all business aspects including sales data, sales reporting, client contracts, client sales targets, growth opportunities, compensation negotiation, commission rates, P&L and invoicing.
• Develop financial and operations targets with clients, then drive the sales team to reach those targets via reporting and strategic analysis. Report results against forecasts.
• Drive revenue and control costs by mining data, analyzing compensation structures, identifying trends and recommending actions.
• Develop and report KPIs for the national sales network
• Work closely with the executive team

SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE
