• Critical Thinking, Strong Interpersonal Skills, Problem Solving, Process Improvement, Requirements Analysis, and Financial Modeling.
• Proven track record of automating processes via modeling and use of excel or operating system.
• Excellent communications skills (verbal and written",2022-07-14,Full-time,data analyst,United States,"['tableau', 'excel']"
