10113,1322,Marketing Database Manager/Data Analyst - Remote US,Marvel Marketers,United States,"At Marvel Marketers, it is our goal to make clients incredibly successful through Expert Services, Strategic Partnerships, and Training. We work with some of the largest brands across the globe and need the best and the brightest to make them successful.

