• Knowledge of statistics and general model building / validation procedures required.
• Intermediate-level skills in MS Excel and MS Access required.
• Strong data skills and the ability to work with massive datasets are required.
• Good problem-solving skills are required.
• Good analytical and critical thinking is required.
• Good written and verbal communication skills are required.

