10300,1509,"Operations Analyst, Performance Management",Oasis Financial,United States,"Oasis seeks a Operations Analyst, Performance Management you will evaluate current business processes and team performance, conduct data analysis, and recommend strategies on improving processes and performance to exceed KPIs, drive profitability and scalability and consistently deliver an industry leading servicing experience. This position will work collaboratively with leaders from Operations... Sales, and Marketing and reports to the VP of Pre-Settlement Operations.

