10392,1601,Lead Data Analyst,EDWARD JONES,"Jamestown, MO","At Edward Jones, we help clients achieve their serious, long-term financial goals by understanding their needs and implementing tailored solutions. To ensure a personal client experience, we have located our 15,000+ branch offices where our more than 7 million clients live and work.

