Under limited supervision, builds and maintains data workflows, dashboards, and analytics projects. Delivers quantitative analyses in presentation ready formats to internal and external customers.

Responsibilities

Manipulates, integrates, and audits data using business intelligence tools that support analysis, business results and reporting requirements.
Develops and summarizes defined analyses into internal and external presentations from integrated data sources that reflect complex custom analytics and data stories.
Assists in designing, developing, testing, and implementing custom-developed cloud native data pipeline (ETL) solutions to support analysis, business results and reporting requirements.
