Department Specific Minimum Qualifications:

Strategic Partnership
• Bachelor’s degree in business, data analytics, market research, economics, statistics, or similar.
• 3+ years of experience in partnership development, performing research, data collection, analysis, and presentation in a large, rapidly growing organization, CRM/Salesforce/or Sales Operations experience.
• Experience with JIRA oriented product ticketing practices and agile project management. Student Success

Preferred Qualifications:
• Master’s degree
• Experience within the higher education sector helpful
• Experience in Sales data analytics for some departments

Physical Requirements:
• Prolonged periods sitting at a desk and working on a computer.
• Must be able to lift up to 15 pounds at times.

