10682,68,Assurance Data Analyst,Plante Moran,Anywhere,"Make your mark. The Plante Moran Technology Services team is recognized as a Computerworld Top 100 Places to Work in IT for four (2018, 2019, 2020, & 2021) consecutive years. In 2021 Plante Moran Technology Services was ranked No. 4 among midsize organizations. In addition to Computerworld Top 100, our team has won two prestigious awards in 2017: InformationWeek IT Excellence and the CIO 100. If... you are seeking professional growth, like being innovative and challenged, and desire to work on impactful business technology projects, we want to hear from you!

Your work will include, but not be limited to:
• Work with data extraction tools to process client audit and tax data more efficiently
• Manipulate and report tabular data, build reports and views
• Acquire a sound understanding of the business areas, their data systems, their interdependencies and collective role for the firm
• Manage the request process and align resources to support timelines
• Define and estimate tasks necessary to accomplish assigned goals
• Design and document process and data flows
• Respond to issues, questions, and make recommendations to team members and management
• Provide training to end users on the use of internally developed or off the shelf tools
• Other duties as assigned

The qualifications.
• Bachelor's degree with a focus in IT, Data Science, Accounting, or equivalent combination of experience/knowledge required
• 1-2 years of experience with data extraction and processing with applications including Alteryx and advanced Excel is required
• 1-2 years of experience with MindBridge or IDEA preferred
• 1-2 years of Assurance or Audit related experience in a professional services environment with a strong technology savvy or data analytics background preferred
• Experience writing professional quality business and technical documentation
• Ability to read, understand, and verify data models
• Demonstrated knowledge of database tools such as SQL
• Demonstrated knowledge of PowerBI or PowerApps
• Demonstrated functional knowledge of the unique database structures used in accounting and financial systems and techniques used for linking systems
• Demonstrated understanding of analytics tools and concepts
• Ability to work independently/self-reliant and show initiative with minimum supervision
• Ability to quickly learn new technologies and apply appropriately to business situations
• Strong team player who enjoys working in a fast-paced team atmosphere
• Ability to work under pressure and meet deadlines
• Ability to listen effectively and seek clarification
• Strong written and verbal communication skills
• Strong analytical skills with the ability to acquire, organize, analyze and disseminate information with attention to detail and accuracy
• Experience working with remote teams
• This position may require some local, national, and occasional international travel.

Our difference.

We are a nationally recognized public accounting, consulting, and wealth management firm, consistently ranked as one of FORTUNE magazine's ""100 Best Companies to Work For."" At Plante Moran, we live by the Golden Rule, fostering a relatively ""jerk-free"" culture with the lowest staff turnover rate in the industry. Our supportive network of well-rounded professionals is excited to catapult your growth and help pave your pathway to professional excellence.

Apply now. Make your mark.

This is an exempt position, so you may have to work hours that exceed the standard 40-hour work week.

Plante Moran is an Equal Opportunity Employer, committed to a diverse workplace.

Interestedapplicantsmust submit their resume for consideration using our applicant tracking system. Due to the high volume of applications received, only candidates selected for interviews will be contacted. Candidates must be legally authorized to work in the United States without sponsorship, with the exception of candidates that are bilingual in Japanese and English. Unsolicited resumes from search firms or employment agencies, or similar, will not be paid a fee and become the property of Plante Moran.

The specific statements above are not intended to be all-inclusive.

