10806,192,Data Analyst - Python / Sql / Health It,"DrFirst, Inc.",Anywhere,"This is a great opportunity to be a part of a successful Healthcare IT company experiencing significant growth. We have proven products, brand-name customers, significant revenue and growth, and are backed by leading investors. Here you'll get to work with some of the smartest and most interesting people around; solving unique and complex challenges in healthcare on a scale matched by few... companies.

