• Problem solving : The problems we are solving are unique and complex. This takes critical thinking, root cause analysis, the ability to handle uncertainty/ ambiguity, and issue dissection with the team to come up with the best solution.
• Analysis : Being able to capture, manipulate and interpret data. Working across marketing, product development and external partner teams, sharing KPI-driven reporting and insights.
• Learning : Our Data and Analytics team is full of life-long learners. We are looking for people who have a growth mindset, stay up on their craft, and always keep an eye out for what’s next. Open Source contributions and cross training opportunities are a way of life here.
• Coding : You'll work with the business to create repeatable python pipelines for querying data and carrying out business analyses. You’ll develop SQL codes to integrate, scrubbing, manipulate, and analyze data.
• Delivering: We are committed to producing world class products. Being skilled at managing competing priorities, pivoting and adjusting quickly, and thinking about the big picture are keys to success.

Qualifications
