10951,337,"12922 - SW Eng (Data Analyst, PowerBI Developer)",Experis,"Kansas City, MO","Data Analyst (PowerBI Developer)

Type: Contract...

Duration: 9-months+

Location: REMOTE

Must Haves:

Mus have proven SQL experience (what should they be able to do with SQL?)
Need someone who can do data mappings from source systems

Effect using Power BI (report writing)

Must be confident in communication

Manager Notes:

Data Analyst / PowerBI report writer
• It's critical that this person be a self-starter, good communicator and proactive with all tasks.
• The new application is pulling data from 13 source systems.
• This person will be responsible for understanding the data model for the new application and working with the source systems to understand how to map the data.
• The source systems are all friendly people, but they are different teams with different priorities.
• This person must be confident in communication and willing to follow-up without the manager pushing.
• We do not have PowerBI configured for our system.
• This person will be responsible for getting the application setup and converting a handful of existing reports as well as creating new ones ongoing.

FORMAL POSITION DESCRIPTION

Data Analyst Job Duties

Data analyst responsibilities include conducting full lifecycle analysis to include requirements, activities, and design.
• Data analysts will develop analysis and reporting capabilities.
• They will also monitor performance and quality control plans to identify improvements.

Responsibilities
• Interpret data, analyze results using statistical techniques and provide ongoing reports
• Develop and implement databases, data collection systems, data analytics and other strategies that optimize statistical efficiency and quality
