Works within the Master Data team and serve as a center for expertise for master data creation and maintenance within Agile PLM and Oracle EBS systems to support the operations in the Pharma Drug Manufacturing
Review master data & Coordinate data enrichment workflows
Responsible for Master Data Management, Data Standardization & Curation, Data Quality, Data Assurance, Data Discovery, Data Enablement and Data Usage for the enterprise
