11246,632,Business Data Analyst,"NewSouth Technologies, Inc.",United States,"NewSouth Technologies, Inc. is seeking a Complex Care Business Analyst to assist in the development of a request for proposal (RFP) to procure and implement a familiar faces software solution for our client.

Familiar faces are individuals with frequent interactions with crisis services such as hospital emergency departments, homeless systems, jails, behavioral health crisis services and... emergency medical services.

This Consultant will be responsible for documenting As-Is patient care workflows and data flows and developing To-Be patient care workflows and data flows for how collaborating agencies will work together to provide more wholistic care for the familiar faces population. To-be workflows and data flows will include patient intake, patient risk assessment, and patient stratification.

The Consultant will be responsible for creating a requirement document suitable for vendor estimation of complexity, cost and timeliness necessary to produce, test, install, train and support the system described above. The system design requires a significant interaction with the collaborative partners to further define and illustrate the functional requirements.

Salary: $60.00 - $80.00 per hour depending on experience

Skills:

Understanding of complex care associated with serving the needs of familiar faces population

Information Systems Requirements Analysis

Data analysis

Excellent writing skills

Excellent meeting facilitation skills

Understanding of electronic medical records and healthcare data, including EPIC data structures

Experience:

Experience with healthcare case management: 3 years

Creating a requirement document to document system requirements: 3 years

Documenting data flows: 3 years

Developing RFPs: 3 years

Software implementation: 3 years

License/Certification:

Business Analyst certification preferred but not required

Work Location: Remote

NewSouth Technologies, Inc is an information technology services consulting company founded in 1998, specializing in helping its clients develop and maintain state-of-the-art information systems and business processes.

Job Types: Full-time, Contract

Pay: $60.00 - $80.00 per hour

Schedule:
8 hour shift
Monday to Friday

Experience:
healthcare case management: 3 years (Required)
developing RFP: 3 years (Required)
Data flow documentation: 3 years (Required)
software implementation: 3 years (Required)
document to document system requirements: 3 years (Required)

