• A proven track record of problem solving based on data driven analytics and product analytics.
• Focused on analyzing and interpreting data in line with the business goals. Effectively serves as the bridge between data and business insights.
• Provide structural recommendations and oversight of future data models.
• Help drive the GuideMe product strategy by designing data models and ensuring they are extensive to support business questions.
• Ensure that business requirements are translated into warehouses as requested in the form of new data flow.
• Ensure data model optimization, standardize templates and implement metadata, Business Glossary and Data Lineage.
• Provide timely information to support senior leadership in decision making.
• Leverage emerging technologies and use analysis to connect people data to business performance data to generate and uncover relevant, actionable insights.
