Qualifications:
• Bachelor's Degree in Business/Computer Science/IT or related field preferred
• 5-7 years of relevant experience
• 5+ years of experience in data modeling, data architecture, data warehousing (on-prem and cloud) data analytics, digital marketing analytics, and/or eCommerce analytics with experience in financial service industry (Life insurance products and business knowledge preferred)
