Apply academic knowledge and learn new skills by contributing to various projects
Research various legal, regulatory, and other topics within functional area and industry
Attend training and development presentations to enhance professional competencies

This is a 2023 Summer intern position, you will be able to work 100% remote/hybrid from anywhere in the US.

Position Purpose:

The purpose of this internship is to pursue a project that is related to the automation and self-serve functionality in reporting analytics. The role is appealing because the intern will get experience with working in a large team and gain the necessary skills to become a solid Data Analyst. The candidate will be most interested in the chance to get to work with real-world datasets that could potentially have real-world impact. They will be working in corporate analytics.
Learn about various processes and functions within the Managed Care industry and develop professionally by contributing to projects that support the business.

