Analyzes data for quality and completeness in accordance with established data governance policy and standards.
Develops scripts to report and extract data for analysis.
Designs and creates the data reporting environment, including data sources, security, and metadata.
Creates data quality control processes to audit extracted lists ensuring data governance is maintained on all processes.
Performs data profiling and business analysis (logical modeling) to determine the most effective ways to measure and provide data.
Applies statistical methods and visualization techniques in generating business insights.
