11926,1312,Senior Data Analyst,Skillsearch Limited,United States,"Do you have data analysis experience, and are you seeking a new remote job in Europe? If so, we'd love to hear from you! Skillsearch is helping a collaborative company recruit a skilled and talented Senior Data Analyst to join their friendly and dedicated team. This full-time data analysis role comes with an attractive salary and benefits package.

