 RUnderstanding of Economic principles and Pricing theoriesAbility to identify, analyze, and provide recommendations to complex business decisionsSolid understanding of statistical analysis and experimentation, and capacity to drive conclusions from the analysisAbility to work across disparate data sources to obtain sensible resultsStrong problem-solving skillsStrong collaboration and communication skills Nice to Have: Experience with a data visualization software a plusExperience with A/B testing a plusExperience analyzing user-centric products, preferably in the gaming or marketplace industries What we can offer: Flexible PTOMedical, dental, & vision insuranceLife insurance and disability benefits401K, HSA, pre-tax savings programsEquityNew equipment setup providedWellness programsTenure recognition Compensation Range: $155,000 - $190,000Gametime is committed to bringing together individuals from different backgrounds and perspectives. We strive to create an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive, feel a sense of belonging, and do great work together. As an equal opportunity employer, we prohibit any unlawful discrimination against a job applicant on the basis of their race, color, religion, veteran status, sex, parental status, gender identity or expression, transgender status, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability or genetic information. We respect the laws enforced by the EEOC and are dedicated to going above and beyond in fostering diversity across our company",2022-03-23,Full-time,data analyst,United States,['python']
