Required Experience :
• 10+ years experience

Required Technical Skills :
• Demonstrated strong data analysis skills
• Ability to create visual representations (e.g., presentations) of complex IT datasets
• Expertise with MS Office suite of tools

Required Skills and Abilities:
• Strong Written and Verbal Communication
• Strong desire for problem solving

Preferred Skills:
• Data Analysis Certifications
• Software Analytics Certifications

Security Clearance Level :
• Must be able to obtain (& maintain) a Client Specific Public Trust
• The security clearance for this program requires the selected candidate to have resided in the US for the past five years. The selected candidate cannot have left the country for longer than 90 consecutive days and no more than 180 cumulative days. U.S. Citizen or Permanent Resident (Green Card Holder).

Location:
• On Customer Site in Washington, DC, Raleigh, NC or REMOTE

GDIT IS YOUR PLACE:
• Full-flex work week to own your priorities at work and at home
• 401K with company match
• Comprehensive health and wellness packages
• Internal mobility team dedicated to helping you own your career
• Professional growth opportunities including paid education and certifications
