12473,1859,Workday Reporting/Data Analyst. Job in Kansas City Gr8Jobs,Corporate,"Kansas City, MO","You could be the one who changes everything for our 26 million members. Centene is transforming the health of our communities, one person at a time. As a diversified, national organization, you'll have access to competitive benefits including a fresh perspective on workplace flexibility.
