13274,799,Data Analyst,STAND 8 Technology Services,United States,"This is an exciting opportunity and we are seeking a Data Analyst / Dashboard Developer (Data Studio & Looker) to work with our Global Media client in an exciting business unit. This role will work with users throughout the business unit to collect requirements, design, and develop dashboards, reports, and conduct ad hoc requests. The Analyst will interact with business users and product owners... to translate business requirements into the specifications needed to produce the necessary dashboard requirements across the business unit.

The Analyst will create and develop Data Studio and Looker dashboards from Google Cloud Platform (GCP) data sources by writing (SQL) Structured Query Language queries against the data models and tables. In addition, the Analyst will perform data mining on data sets and generate insights from the results for users. We're setting up interviews with candidates this week and look forward to hearing from you

This position must be worked onsite in a Hybrid schedule in the Greater Los Angeles area (close to Hollywood) requiring the work to be done onsite Tue-Thu. We have a direct client relationship on this project and are setting up interviews next week for someone who can hit the ground running building innovative solutions. Be prepared to make an immediate impact and join a collaborative, fast-paced, cross-functional team gaining exposure to stakeholders and business partners.

STAND 8 is a strategic services and staffing company that partners great talent with amazing opportunities in technology solutions for all industries. We work with top-tier clients nationally across the US with offices in LA, Atlanta, New York and more.

Responsibilities
• Works with product owners and business users to analyze and understand business requirements.
• Uses SQL code to develop required dashboards in Google Data Studio and Looker pulling data from GCP and other enterprise data sources.
• Perform data analysis on data sets, conduct data mining and generate insights for the business and stakeholders.

