Work that matters, fueled by passion for pets!

At Hill's we have a purpose. Every day around the world, we transform the lives of millions of pet families through pioneering innovation, amazing nutrition, and the best and brightest people.

Join our amazing team in Topeka, Kansas and contribute to change the lives of millions of pets around the world.

Manufacturing Data Analyst

The Manufacturing Data Analyst is responsible for system integrated tracking and reporting of Hill's Pet Nutrition performance and operational data and KPIs.

This role will review and redesign our manufacturing team processes to improve system effectiveness, drive data driven decision making and improve business responsiveness. Are you curious and creative when allocating information and/or improving ERPs processes? You definately need to apply!

Principal Duties and Responsibilities
• Master data management in SAP - SKU set up, packaging set up
• Place purchase orders to external partners according to the allocated capacity
• Periodic up-date of SKU prices in the system
• Enter actual production quantities and recording Post Goods Issue
• Process Inventory adjustments
• Manage goods receipt vs invoice receipt balance
• Manage yield reports
• Support Finance with timely payment resolutions
• Support month end close process
• Support working capital and cost of obsolescence management
• Manage and order packaging components for the co-packing operations
• Use integrated performance KPIs and analytical tools to identify patterns, trends and solutions

This is not an exhaustive list of duties or functions.

Education/ Experience Requirements
• SAP experience
• Advanced proficiency in MS Excel / Google sheets
• Experience in plant operations role (preferred)
• Bachelor's Degree in business or technical discipline

Salary Range $68,880 - $101,220 USD

Pay is based on several non discriminatory factors including but not limited to experience, education, skills and office location. In addition to your salary, Colgate-Palmolive offers a performance based bonus and competitive benefits package.

