• Bachelor's Degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, Business or other related discipline
• Six (6) years of related experience performing tasking similar to that described above
• An understanding of healthcare electronic healthcare records systems and data is critical,
• An understanding of specific DHA information systems (ie CHCS, DEERS, AHLTA, CoPath, Cerner, etc) is advantageous

Desired Qualifications:
• PM experience or PMP certification

