13552,1077,Lead Data Analyst,Yoh,United States,"Title: Lead Data Analyst
Location: Remote, with travel to Memphis TN when necessary
Salary: 130K (W2 Only...
Duration: Direct Hire
Client: Healthcare
-
SUMMARY
Our client is seeking a highly talented Lead Data Analyst to join their leadership team and manage the delivery of analytics. Throughout the institution, across the clinical, research, administrative, and operational domains there are many analytics customers who need access to accurate data and insightful analytics.

Responsible for managing these customer relationships and delivering top notch analytical solutions to them.
-
Requirement:
-
· Minimum of six (6) progressive years of IT experience including strong database design, data architecture and data transform processes.
· 4 years of exclusive analytics solutions architecture experience is highly preferred
· Experience in data architecture and design.
· Be versed in Cloud solutions (Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud Platform, Microsoft, Azure, Snowflake cloud) or Big Data solutions and related technologies
· Expert level PowerBI development experience is highly preferred
· Expertise in data architecture concepts such as data modeling, workflow management, ETL/ELT, real-time streaming)
· Understanding data management and governance concepts such as data quality, metadata, dependency management, etc.
· Excellent oral and written communication skills including the ability to communicate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders
· Willingness and ability to learn, adapt and apply new technologies
· Preferred experience with Microsoft Azure/Synapse/Power BI, Epic EHR, or Workday ERP

