• Attention to detail
• Ability to manage multiple priorities
• Personable
• Database/content administration
• Ability to learn and/or adapt to new technologies/tools

What We Offer:

Dodge Construction Network offers a competitive total compensation plan plus a full array of health, wellness and financial security benefits designed to provide you with peace of mind so that you can bring your best self to work. DCN is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for candidates with disabilities in our recruiting process. If you need any assistance or accommodations due to a disability, please let us know. We are committed to leveraging the talent of a diverse workforce to create great opportunities for our business and our people.

