SUMMARY

As a part of the data analytics team, the Data Analyst develops, implements, and supports clinical enterprise applications including Epic and/or departmental applications. Additionally, the Data Analyst will support the organization by reporting on outcomes of the organization’s operations to senior leadership and other outside entities as required.

