14451,1976,SENIOR DATA ANALYST,UniGroup,Anywhere,"The Senior Data Analyst is part of a core team that enables strategic decision making throughout the company. Strong verbal and written communication, with time management skills are key to success in this role. This role will be able to consume, process and analyze the largest household goods datasets in the world in collaboration with other analysts, investigators, and subject matter experts... The right candidate should be passionate about data and analytics with a positive and solution-oriented mindset.

