About the Role...

Forwood Safety is looking to recruit a Data Analyst into their industry-leading Benchmarking and Analytics team. This role will be responsible for managing our existing datasets and providing product support to our analytics clients, as well as designing future data solutions and expanding our range of predictive analytics capabilities. The team works with data collected via our own software solutions, combined with secondary data sources as needed.

Working with our delivery partner AWS, this role involves working on the cutting edge of cloud-based analytics and industry leading insights. This role reports to the post of Leader – Analytics and Benchmarking, with links into product development and platform teams. Forwood Safety practices Agile methodology and this role sits within an Agile team and may involve Scrum or Kanban methodology. This role will involve working regularly with teams in Europe, India and Australia. Read about one of recent collaborations with AWS here: https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/bigdata/forwood-safety-uses-amazon-quicksight-q-to-extend-life-saving-safety-analytics-tolarger-audiences/

