Accountabilities
• Understanding the business needs and technologies to help the Analytics and Benchmarking team deliver increments of deployable product for each item of work.
• Developing new user-facing datasets and analyses using AWS cloud analytics, including AWS QuickSight, Athena and Redshift.
• Maintain the integrity of the reporting tools; identifying problems, suggesting improvements and owning the quality of the reporting portfolio.
• Demonstrate and live the values of the company.

Candidate Requirements:

Qualifications
