Essential
• 3+ years of experience as a Data Analyst in a client-facing role.
• Data analytics skills using a visualisation tool such as AWS QuickSight, PowerBI or Tableau, particularly in producing and maintaining analytics products for external users (ie, for customers outside of the organisation).
• Experience of cloud analytics tools, eg Power BI, Tableau.
• Experience of working with data that is processed via an AWS stack (eg Redshift, Athena).
• Experience in Agile and Scrum.
• Ability to understand business requirements and use them to design data requirements for a variety of business needs.

Desirable
• AWS Certified in Data Analytics or similar Speciality pathway.
• Experience using AWS QuickSight.
