Ivy Rehab Network is looking to hire a Research & Outcomes Data Analyst preferably in the New Jersey / New York / Connecticut / Pennsylvania territory with the ability to work remotely.
We have an exciting opportunity to join our team as a Research & Outcomes Data Analyst! In this role, the successful teammate will be responsible integrating, analyzing, and... visualizing extensive datasets to support the growth and development of Ivy Rehab’s Outcomes program and strategic approach to utilization of clinical outcomes in various settings. This role will be a part of a fast-paced, results driven environment that fosters employee growth and career development.
Qualifications
