• Demonstrated proficiency in SQL/DAX/querying languages
• Proficiency in Advanced Excel Visualization/Microsoft Power BI
• Demonstrated experience with report/dashboard development, data/report automation, self-service capabilities, data design and integration, or data quality and governance preferred
