The Property Assessment Technology (PAT) Unit assists with design, implementation, enhancement, maintenance and analysis of application software and systems in the Property Division. The Unit's functions include maintaining and testing systems related to property valuation and researching new technology products. The selected candidate will report to the Deputy Director of Property Tax Systems.

Responsibilities include, but are not limited to, the following:
• Serve as Property's technical liaison with Finance IT (FIT) and property subject matter experts (SMEs).
