• Define detailed specifications for change orders. Test and validate change orders
• Perform regular CAMA and PTS training for business users, and act as the key contact to business users for troubleshooting data errors
• Provide technical support to all users of the CAMA and PTS systems
• Author all RPIE related communications and collaborate with External Affairs for the best method of distribution (web, letters, email blasts).
• Streamline process for tracking all correspondences and resolutions to improve customer experience.
