14755,226,Data Analyst - Mentor role - Remote,OpenClassrooms,Anywhere,"OpenClassrooms mentors are freelance senior professionals. They help students succeed in their training programs, through weekly video calls of maximum one hour each. It’s a 100% remote mission. You can coach up to 5 students from the beginning.

