Job Summary:

The Reporting and Data Enablement team acts as subject matter experts and stewards of our guest data across the business. The team is at the center of driving and enabling our data-driven strategic initiatives and collaborates closely with our lines of business and go-to-market teams.

As an Analyst of Reporting and Data Enablement, you will be responsible for leading and contributing to strategic initiatives that rely on our central data assets. You will act as a catalyst across our business, analytics, and IT teams to ensure that the right data is available and fit for purpose to drive accurate reporting and strategic insights across the enterprise. This role will have involvement with multiple Lines of Business teams, primarily Channel and Test & Learn teams, helping to build and maintain the reporting infrastructure to enable Business Insights.

