17463,2934,Data Analyst required for historical Analysis of plant Data ...,Upwork,Anywhere,"Current phase of our requirement is to start with only a historical analysis of the data captured from 6 plants across two different factory sites (3 individual plants in two factory location). Each of the 6 plants have very similar Scada data which is collected and stored every 15 minutes

