My requirement is for the data to be analyzed and feedback given from a statistical / data analytical perspective on how to increase our efficiency in our production operations. Attached with his posting are 4 excel files. Three of those files consists of sample data of one plant for 3 months (Jan to March of 2020). Looking at these files, I would like to maximize output from the two cells of:

1. Increasing production per 15 minutes ( Column number BK of production every 15 minutes) and 2. Increasing kgs produced per unit of electricity in KwHr of electricity consumed (Column number DP).

So I would like to understand how the other factors in the production data sheet influence these two columns in a positive or negative way.

The deliverable is to provide a dashboard / model to show which parameters or in what conditions we maximise our production per 15 minutes, and our production per unit in KwHr of electricity consumed, that is both those columns (BK and DP) mentioned above.

I would also like a copy of all the code along with documentation. The contractor too needs to be available to demonstrate the results got based on the analysis. This is the first phase of the project. Later phases will be to add real time data to the model so that the model can prompt for action to be taken immediately to achieve highest production efficiency. Other plants from other factories will need to be added too. So the model will need to be structured and designed, and the code written, documented and delivered in such a way that other phases can be added on when required.

The contractor should also be available for an online discussion before the project is confirmed and demonstrate his findings after too.

Attached are four sample files:

1. file name: DataLog report Plant1 jan 2020.xlsx has sample data for one plant (Plant 1) for the month of Jan 2020

2. File name: DataLog report Plant 1 Feb 2020.xlsx has sample data for the same plant (Plant 1) for the month of Feb 2020

