Job Description

Our client is looking for an experienced Data Analyst with healthcare experience and strong technical and analytic skills. This person will work with a team interfacing with the business analysts and technical resources to perform analysis on source systems develop requirement specifications and assist with troubleshooting and remediating data quality issues.

Key Responsibilities
• Ability to work independently and to set priorities while managing several projects simultaneously; strong attention to detail is essential.
• Collaborates with Business Systems Analysts and/or directly with key business users to ensure business requirements and report specifications are documented accurately and completely.
