• Document data sources and processing flow.
• Support QA and UAT teams in defining test scenarios and clarifying requirements.
• Effectively communicate results of the data analysis to internal and external customers to support decision making.
• Follows established SDLC, change control, release management and incident management processes.
• Perform source data analysis and assessment.
• Perform data profiling to capture business and technical rules.
