This position provides technical and analytical support for the Distribution Integrity Management Program (DIMP). Tasks include:
• Performs analysis of distribution pipeline data to determine threats and risks inherent to pipeline operations and assists in developing mitigation plans to reduce those risks.
• Utilizes a variety of systems including, but not limited to SQL, Power BI, GIS, Risk Modeling Tools and other analytical software.
• Performs advanced SQL queries to obtain data from various systems across the Company and uses that data to create meaningful information and reports to identify trends, patterns, or anomalies.
• Effectively maintains large volumes of data to demonstrate compliance.

Analyst I
Functional Expertise:
