Systems Support:
• Plan, facilitate and execute system/functional testing and UAT for projects and enhancements
• Understand the relationships, dependencies and impact of neighboring business functions
• Knowledge of core systems, applications and technical platforms
• Coordinate tactical-related business requests for IT development enhancements

Technical Competencies:
• Proficient in modeling/mapping as-is and to-be business processes, test planning, test case development and execution.
• Proficiency with Agile / Lean methodologies, Microsoft Project, Office, Azure DevOps and process mapping applications.

As our ideal candidate, you have:
• Experience: 4+ years of overall IT experience including software development processes, planning, facilitating, eliciting, documenting and managing business, functional and technical requirements
