Mattermost is seeking a passionate data enthusiast to solve data analytics and engineering problems in the Marketing, Sales, Finance, Product and Engineering organizations. As a data-driven organization, Mattermost relies on our data team to drive marketing insights, ensure accurate data across systems, iterate on current key business metrics, and dive into complex datasets to answer business-critical questions.In this role, you will work closely with the Finance, Marketing, Sales, Product and Engineering organizations to deeply understand customer trends, analyze marketing activities, product adoption, and sales results in order to surface insights that impact the health of the overall business. If you are data-obsessed, love connecting the dots, thrive in an iterative environment, and aren’t afraid to get your hands dirty, this is the role for you.

