Job Description
Responsible for gathering, structuring, and analyzing data and providing recommendations to management. Supports the development of standard data analyses, reports, and dashboards.
What You'll Do
• Gather, structure, and analyze data, and provide recommendations to management.
• Support development of standard data analyses, reports, and dashboards.
• Actively manage and escalate risk and customer-impacting issues within the day-to-day role to management.

How You'll Do It
• Gather, structure, and analyze data from multiple data sources.
• Partner with the business to identify appropriate data sources and analysis methodology to meet business needs.
• Present results of data analyses and recommendations to management and process owners.
• Support development of standard data analyses, reports, and dashboards.
• Demonstrate technical knowledge with analytical tools.

Qualifications You'll Need
The Basics
• Master's degree in computer science, engineering, statistics, mathematics or related field
• 1+ years of experience in programming with a concentration in data science, or related field
• Experience with Python, SQL, and cloud-based platforms such as AWS

Bonus Points If You Have
• 2+ years of experience in programming with a concentration in data science, or related field

