• Troubleshoots data integrity issues, analyzes data for completeness to meet business needs, and proposes documented solution recommendations. Coordinates resolution to any/all system issues affecting team
• Presents data and analysis in a clear and concise manner allowing the audience to quickly understand the results and recommendations so they act upon them and make data driven decisions
• Create standards to bring data into a common structure with a goal of effective analysis techniques and business solutions recommendations. Leads analytical projects by coordinating all stages of the development life cycle
• Recommends and implements new or modified reporting methods and procedures to improve business processes, report content and completeness of information
• Collaborate with IT and/or analytics peers, where appropriate, to troubleshoot errors and data inconsistencies and coordinates resolutions to issues as directed by self and leadership
