• Develop and implement improvements to credit portfolio monitoring, client review tracking, management reporting, and customer risk rating assignments
• Partner with product, engineering, and finance teams to create and maintain risk adjusted returns framework, including loss forecasting, and execute credit policies and features Implement risk metric monitoring and develop risk mitigation strategies

Requirements:
• 3+ years in credit risk management.
• Experience in commercial credit risk preferred
• Experience with consumer/corporate credit cards, payments, lending, or related industries
• Understanding of the fundamentals of credit risk for commercial credit
• Experience in architecting, implementing, and interpreting risk/scoring models in conjunction with data science teams
