18512,240,Data Analyst,Progrexion,United States,"We are looking for a Data Analyst who will quickly make an impact on our business. We are looking for a problem solver & decision maker. This person will work in concert with stakeholders to improve our core products through recommendations for testing different experiences and advertisements. They will also work with other analysts & data scientists to build algorithms to improve... click-thru-rates and conversions. This role also includes generating reports and some aspects of data engineering. This position interacts with all levels of leadership within our organization.

