• Perform ad hoc deep-dives to analyze problems and opportunities, identify the hypothesis, and design and execute experiments to meaningfully improve customer experience and meet business goals.
• Explore, develop, and present insights that inform roadmap and strategy.

After 1 Year:
• In close partnership with Growth + Product, continue to identify metrics and levers to help drive Hatch’s business strategy.
• Develop frameworks, models, tools, and processes to ensure that analytical insights can be incorporated into all key decision-making.
• Establish protocols and best practices for experimentation and data collection.
