• Analyze data related to workforce management and business operations to improve processes and experiences
• Build and deliver time sensitive analyses to influence strategy and execution
• Craft innovative solutions and strategies by combining data and intuition
• Work with global partners to build solutions for global problems
• Manage initiatives throughout the project lifecycle, from inception to completion
• Drive implementation, measure execution, and iterate with field and operations teams
• Lead with collaboration, inclusion, and the ability to take others on the journey
• Identify, communicate, and foster innovative ideas through partnership
• Provide initiative-based support and subject matter expertise on the store perspective

Droisys is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status or any other characteristic protected by law. Droisys believes in diversity, inclusion, and belonging, and we are committed to fostering a diverse work environment",2022-09-12,Contractor,data analyst,United States,"['tableau', 'sql', 'excel']"
