We are looking for a Revenue Operations Data & Reporting Analyst to join our Revenue Operations team and partner with our other workstreams and go-to-market departments to build, own, and manage related reporting and analysis needs with a strong emphasis on Marketing. This role will report to the Sr. Manager of Revenue Operations and be responsible for leading key analytics projects, working closely with leaders across Revenue Operations and its stakeholder teams (Marketing, Sales, AM, and Customer Operations) to scope, create and deliver reporting, analyses and insights which drive decision making by those customer-facing teams. The individual must be highly motivated, a self-starter with a strong track record of achievements, and both an obsession for rigorous work and bias for action.

