• Track and measure the performance of individual tactics, channels, and campaigns, and how they compare to one another and change with seasonality or over time
• Calculate and track return on investment through customer acquisition cost and lifetime value
• Act as a go-to resource by telling the story of marketing opportunities and results for the company through clear, concise data
• Analyze data and historical campaign trends to provide insight and recommendations; ultimately informing GTM tactics and strategy

Here’s what we’re looking for:
