Extracts and analyzes institutional data using independent judgement when required in order to support institutional decision-making processes for the Council of Chancellors, Senior Leaders at UM’s four universities, and the Board of Curators. Makes recommendations as necessary and appropriate to enhance data collection and reporting. Support PeopleSoft data entry and data audits related to administrative processes and reporting efforts. Works with stakeholders and other subject matter experts to develop and provide basic actionable information and in support of improvement initiatives. Attend standing and additional meetings to work through issues and develop plans. Ability to use PowerBI and other tools for data modeling, data relationships and visualization to support KPI dashboards and ad hoc analysis. Performs other job-related duties as assigned.

