Class meets once weekly on Wednesdays from 5:30 - 8:30 pm CT. Class starts January 4th, 2023, and is estimated to run through June 14th, 2023. The Lead Instructor may be required to attend training sessions prior to class start. Class is planned to currently meet in person at Rockhurst University. Due to class being in person, we are not accepting applications from outside of our hub locations. Please note that all course staff would still be expected to be available at the class times listed above.

The instructor can expect to work up to 6 hours per week.

Lead Instructor for this track is paid a total of $7,500. This is a 1099 Independent Contractor role.

