• Experience with Amazon KMS (Key Management Service), Apache Hadoop, Apache Hive, Databricks, Flyaway, Hibernate 4, Kafka, Kibana, Liquibase, Logstash, PostgreSQL, SharePoint.
• Experience in an Agile DevOps environment.
• Previous federal or government experience, specifically supporting DHS USCIS.
