19147,875,Data Analyst,"Boyd Caton Group, Inc.",United States,"What We Are Looking For

Boyd Caton Group, Inc. (bcg) is seeking a full-time Data Analyst to work in our Charlottesville offices. We are not just consultants that develop products: We create solutions that positively impact the lives of others. Our thriving employees relentlessly strive to bring value to the lives of our clients, the industries we serve, and each other. Through diversity of ideas... and focused ideals, we build relationships based on principles of service and gratitude. We’re looking for an energetic, reliable, confident self-starter to join our team. If you are looking for a rewarding work environment with a growing company, let’s chat.

Spend your days
• Validating annual data reports submitted by public transit operators across the U.S.
• Providing technical assistance to industry stakeholders submitting annual and/or monthly data reports.
• Supporting training for industry stakeholders learning about data reporting systems (may require travel up to 3 times annually).
• Providing support for other special projects including policy documentation, webinars, performance reporting, archived data review, and data product quality checking.
• Testing software for interface improvements.

Bring with you
• Bachelor’s Degree (BA or BS) from an accredited school.
