• Company paid dental insurance
• Company paid life insurance of $25K
• Company paid short- and long-term disability insurance
• A 401K plan with a total of 4% company match
• 15 days of PTO
• Additional ancillary benefits including Vision, Cancer, Critical Illness, Hospital Indemnity, Voluntary Life/AD&D, Accident and Legal
• Company paid parking at HQ",2022-09-04,Full-time,data analyst,United States,"['sharepoint', 'powerpoint', 'sql', 'excel']"
