19641,1369,Data Integrity Analyst,Bibbero Systems Inc,Anywhere,"Bibbero Systems Inc is pleased to announce that the position of a Data Integrity Analyst has become available. This position works under our Data Entry team. It is a work from home position that requires working with several departments within our company, as well as technicians all over the US and Canada to assist in closing out jobs with field technicians. Everyone that is a part of the Bibbero... Systems Inc team is family. We work together as one unit with the goal of great customer service with a fun workplace in mind.

Data integrity is a critical part of any organization's infrastructure and enables better insights, lower expenses, and increased efficiency. Data integrity describes both the state of data (i.e., valid or invalid) and the process for achieving the valid state with tactics such as error checking and anomaly detection.

Job Responsibilities:

· Analyze the data submitted by technicians in the Jobspark and TrackVia systems

· Monitor the quality, accuracy and consistency of data contained in job closeouts and identify discrepancies

· Review language used by techs, clarity of information, and more

