Key Responsibilities

Job Summary
• Technically analyze a series of PL/SQL, TSQL, SSIS and other scripts/packages to plan and implement a refactoring process using the R scripting language
• Refactor PL/SQL code to R script with markdown
• Refactor TSQL code to R script with markdown
