1st shift position, 7 am to 3:30 pm but these times can be flexible

See attachment for job duties and requirements.

Manager is open to recent grad candidates. Interviews will be conducted via Teams. Business casual dress code. Position has the potential of driving personal vehicles to other Waterloo sites for meetings. This position will work onsite immediately.

