• 4+ years of experience working with MS SQL Server and Azure SQL Database
• 4+ years of experience developing ETL processes with data warehouses
• 4+ years of experience with Microsoft BI Stack (SSIS, SSRS and SSAS)
• 3+ years’ experience developing data models from OLTP, Data Warehouse, Data Mart, or Analysis Services solutions
• Experience using Azure Data Factory, Azure Data Lakes, and associated technologies
