As an individual contributor, the Data Analyst will research, develop, and deploy actionable and best-in-class statistical models that measurably improve the Supply Chain’s effectiveness and overall outcomes. The candidate maintains component/part master data within ERP for the Supply Chain, ensuring data integrity and process compliance. The position will report to the Manager, Data Analytics.

