• Create/maintain standardized reporting in Power Query/BI in different areas on Supply Chain to support growing business needs.
• Build out dynamic supplier segmentation models that predict commodity spend and support Supply Chain performance metrics via intelligent benchmarking.
• Process map existing order creation/update/discontinuation flow and use workflow tools to systematically steer the process.
