• Analyze and articulate business requirements and translate them into functional requirements.
• Creation and maintenance of various BI reports, analysis, and Power Point presentations.
• Provide actionable insights that can be easily interpreted by leadership by designing, developing, and maintaining ongoing metrics, reports, data mining, analyses, dashboards that drive meaningful and prompt actionable insights.
• Create and maintain supply chain databases and database connections, including but not limited to SharePoint, Azure, AX, D365, etc., while leveraging data automation tools such as MS Flow and Power Query.

