KEY FOCUS AREAS:
• Strategy: Accountable for support to PMM and Marketing delivering insights on consumers and competitors to guide decisions. Provide insight on relevant industry trends that could impact Linqto's strategy and business decisions, with recommendations on potential actions. Importantly, serve as the data backbone for our “voice of the consumer”.
• Execution: Develop actionable frameworks for identifying growth opportunities, assessing in-market performance, and improving the execution of key initiatives. Present and leverage macro trends, point-of-sale data, panel data, loyalty data, Consumer Segmentation, social metrics, in-market testing, competitive benchmarking, and custom research to generate business ideas and drive results
