• Experience with statistics (A/B testing, confidence intervals, hypothesis testing) is a plus.
• Ability to collect, organize, analyze and disseminate large amounts of information with accuracy and attention to detail.
• Ease in the creation of dashboards and reports, clear and concise written and verbal communication style.
• Independent and pro-active, organized, have the ability to multi-task and work effectively in a fast-paced environment.

EXTRA QUALITIES:
• Interest or experience in financial services or fintech companies
• Ability to prioritize tasks and succeed under the pressure of time, changing and exciting situations, and high expectations from team leadership
• Experience with Mixpanel, Hubspot, and Google Analytics

