Near Visual Acuity - FREQUENTLY

Sitting - CONSTANTLY

Lighting - CONSTANTLY

Indoors - FREQUENTLY

Memory - FREQUENTLY

Understand and follow direction - FREQUENTLY

Regular and reliable attendance - CONSTANTLY

