• Work with VP/Director to conduct market analyses and analyze product lines and the overall profitability of the business.
• Develop standardized process in regard to customer reporting, KPI’s, financial dashboards, and data quality metrics to ensure business data and reporting needs are met.
• Service field sales personnel on ad hoc data requests/projects
