The Senior Report Analyst, People & Culture will use their expertise to provide analytics across the People & Culture organization to quantify the impact of P&C programs and assist leaders in decision making. This role will support in the assessment of current analytics and reporting capabilities and ensure consistency when analyzing data across the organization. Through... effective partnering they will assist leaders in the identification and measurement of outcomes. This role will aid the organization in measuring the success of P&C programs and identifying areas of focus to improve programs and outcomes.

