In this position, you will be a member of our client's AF Solutions Corporate Accounts Pricing & Contracts team supporting the integration of our newly acquired Access Solutions division. The responsibilities will be focused on developing AF Solutions' pricing and analytics tools. This will include working on various key projects involving the creation of data management, analysis, and reporting. This role requires advanced excel and analytical skills, a high level of business acumen, multi-tasking skills, contract management, comprehensive organizational skills, and attention to detail. As needed, this role will support data entry into our contract repository system or prepare price load documentation for the Contract Center of Excellence team.

Your responsibilities will include the following:
• Partner with P&C Manager to identify data requirements for tools that support P&C pricing and analytical needs.
