The Sr. Data Analyst (Data Quality Engineer) has the primary responsibility to support the data warehouse in BigQuery and ensure that data is accurate and available for reporting, analytics, and other stakeholders. Our ideal candidate for the Sr. Data Analyst is experienced in making sense of data thru performing data analysis using sql queries and then creating structures that are easy to understand and use for reporting and analytics.

