This role requires partnership across our matrix organization to create analytics dashboards & solutions that answer specific, business critical questions. The MSC Technical Business Analyst collaborates with project managers, data analysts, developers, QA and our clients to ensure projects run smoothly and deliver quality products that are accurate, intuitive and a pleasure to use. They capture requirements & value stories, assess data availability, tracking down sources and profiling data, help document solutions and manage implementations. Strong understanding of business analysis, technical project management, data and analytics are imperative in this role. The successful candidate be resourceful, adaptive & results oriented facing tight deadlines or shifting priorities.

