• Work closely with Product/Engineering to ensure deliveries align to expectations and timelines
• Document clear and detailed specifications for user stories
• Facilitate Agile development, prioritizing deliverables according to business needs. Participate in daily stand ups to monitor progress and steer decision points
• Provide Product, Engineers & QA with SME support and feedback during development & QC.
• Review & approve QC plans and source validation reports, and participate in QC activities-
• Conduct first level UAT and coordinate UAT & sign off with business.
• Review & update runbooks and other documentation
