• Ability to regularly learn and adopt new technology.
• Exceptional analytic and problem-solving skillset with a strong curiosity for data discovery.
• Experience building data catalogs, business glossaries and metadata management.
• Experience with cloud-based analytics platforms on AWS and/or Microsoft Azure a plus.
• Ability to work well with others in fast paced, dynamic environment.
