• Liaise with MLOps and technology teams to build capabilities and infrastructure.
• Liaise with data team to identify opportunities in new and/or alternative data sources.
• Take ownership of a rich library of AI/ML tools and enjoy authority to continue to research efficient and effective strategies.
• Stay concurrent with the cutting edge and bleeding edge of NLP/ML/DL algorithms, methodologies in the open source community and vendor solutions.

Requirements
• You should have a Master or PhD in quantitative fields, preferably Math, Physics, Statistics, Engineering, Computer Science or Data Science.
