• You should have deep understanding of the business dynamics; and proactively lead/conduct exploratory data analyses and experimental designs.
• You should have strong communication and influential skills necessary to ensure high synergy and alignment with other business functions.
• You should be a team- and result-oriented, and self-driven superstar with minimal supervision, as well as open-minded and strategic thinker.

In addition to semi-monthly salary payments, this position is also eligible for an annual incentive bonus based on individual and company performance. Base salary range $185,000 - $220,000. Annual bonus target 20% of base salary. This position may also be eligible for long-term cash and/or equity incentives.

