22692,2141,"Analyst, Market Intelligence and Insights","IMA Financial Group, Inc.",United States,"What You’ll Do

This role will be a central pillar of IMA’s content strategy, Market Intelligence and Insight. The Analyst, Market Intelligence & Insights will be responsible for the research and development of IMA’s thought leadership specific to the insurance marketplace, including pricing product line trends, new entrants and more. This research will include working with IMA’s Data Strategy ... Analytics team to mine IMA’s data for trends, working directly with carrier partners and with IMA’s Carrier Relationships team to leverage their data points and insights as well as scouring third party data sources and analysis with the guidance of the Marketing Specialist – Market Intelligence & Insights.

