Bachelor's Degree in business, statistics, engineering, economics, or math.

3-5 Years’ Experience In Digital Marketing Preferred.

Experience with any of the following helpful: SQL, Adobe Campaign Standard, Adobe Real-Time Customer Data Platform, LiveRamp.

