JOB SUMMARY/OVERVIEW

The. Sr. Marketing Data Analyst will be responsible for tracking marketing KPIs & metrics, analyzing marketing and customer data to discover insights, designing and developing dashboards and reports for CMO and marketing leadership teams to monitor and analyze marketing performance.

Essential Duties/Responsibilities
• Maintain and improve the CMO dashboard.
• Build BI dashboards and reports for marketing leaders to make data-driven decisions.
• Provide weekly marketing performance reports & updates.
• Conduct deep analysis of marketing data to discover insights about campaign performance, channel effectiveness, demand gen efficiency and pipeline conversion, etc.
• Benchmark performance across all online channels, conducting trending analysis and return on investment analysis.
• Analyze customer segments and their journey against target KPIs, such as funnel conversion and digital engagements, providing optimization recommendations.
• Build PowerPoint slides and narratives to share insights across sales, marketing and product teams.

Job Requirements And Qualifications

Education
