23014,204,Data Analyst - Remote,Talentify.io,Anywhere,"Talentify helps candidates around the world to discover and stay focused on the jobs they want until they can complete a full application in the hiring company career page/ATS.

Job Description...

Data Analyst - Remote
• Contract Duration: 1 year
• Pay rate up to $50/Hr

Basic Qualifications For Consideration
• Knowledge and working experience of scrum-based Agile methodology.
• Effectively communicating insights and plans to cross-functional team members and management.
• Strong analytical skills, problem-solving, communication skills, and presentation skills
• Knowledge of full data migration implementation lifecycle including pre-project phase's execution – Data profiling, Data cleansing, Estimation, etc.
• Conducting meetings and discussions with Businesses to resolve the queries encountered during data mapping.
