Position Type: Contract...

Location: Princeton, NJ, United States

Description:

We are looking for a Sr. Data Analyst for our team.

This person will be responsible for solving complex business problems and issues using data from internal and external sources to provide insight to decision-makers. Responsible for defining business intelligence requirements for individual areas; developing conceptual data models, design reports with wireframes, build strong visualizations and test sets for reporting and analytic business intelligence needs. Works cross-functionally to collect data and makes actionable recommendations at all levels.

PRIMARY RESPONSIBILITIES

• Primarily responsible for managing the end to end life cycle of reporting and analytics from designing dashboards, building them, driving insights and building data stories for user consumption

