• Defines metrics, calculations and sources of data in the form of data dictionaries, data source listings, data relationships and more for all data reporting teams

• Solid understanding of business and operational KPI's and it's impact using the visualizations from the front-end BI tools such as Tableau or Power BI, and weaving the data story to answer business questions

