23202,392,User Test Data Analyst (Temp/Contract),iRobot,Anywhere,"Introduction

iRobot’s User Test team mission is to de-risk the design of our products and provide directional guidance on the future economic success of the product. Through extensive in-home testing, the UT team gathers the voice of the customer and validates technical improvements and design choices during the development process. Throughout the testing, the team analyzes the results and... curates critical product performance insights that are shared with the technical teams, the product teams and the executive team.

iRobot is seeking a Temporary Contract User Test Data Analyst to play an important role during new product development, enabling us to make better, more robust robots that delight the customer. In this role, the UT Analyst will provide insights to customer needs and preferences as well as validate that the prototype robot and/or new software features work as expected. This position will work closely with the Chief Engineer, Product Managers, Data Science and Analytics, as well as other engineering disciplines (Software Engineering, Test Engineering, Systems Engineering) and User Experience leads. The successful candidate will have experience or capability to quickly learn all aspects of user-facing alpha testing.

