23367,557,Senior Data Analyst,Lob,Anywhere,"Lob was built by technical co-founders with a vision to make the world programmable.

We offer two flagship APIs (print & mail and address verification) that enable companies to send postal mail as effortlessly as sending emails. Lob is venture-backed by the most reputable investors in tech, and we are rapidly growing our team to shape the future of our company and meet the demands of a quickly... growing customer base and dynamic product offerings.

As a proud Pledge 1% company, we’re committed to leveraging our product, partnerships, and people to drive positive social impact through Lob.org, and are on a mission to make direct mail more sustainable.

About The Role

The Data team is a blend of both analysts and engineers; we collaborate on curating data sets, and then use that data to generate useful insights. Our team helps to monitor key metrics of the business, as well as providing analysis that informs our future choices.

As a Senior Data Analyst at Lob, you’ll...
• Work daily with the engineers that build data models and pipelines to inform their priorities
• Embed with different teams across the organization to understand their data needs and provide actionable analysis
• Partner with Engineering, Product, and Operations to build dashboards that enable teams to inform the choices they make on a day-to-day basis
• Know when to dig deeper on a request in order to solve the root cause with process and automation

What You Will Bring To This Role...
