As a Senior Data Analyst, you will be charged with implementing and supporting enterprise BI capabilities across business functions against high volume data sources. The ideal candidate will utilize their strong BI knowledge to provide data and architecture, vision and design from modeling through to visualization and insight development. This role requires a proactive personality... extremely analytical mindset, attention to detail, and excellent time management and communication skills.

