What You'll Do

We're looking for an Analytics Engineer to join the Data Science team. The Analytics Engineer works closely with business intelligence analysts, data analysts, data architects, data engineers, data scientists, and business stakeholders to design and deploy efficient data models, data pipelines, and ETL/ELT processes that deliver useful data. This role is responsible for driving the success of our analytics programs through the production, documentation, and curation of certified data sources that empower analysts throughout the organization to make data driven decisions. The Analytics Engineer is relied upon by decision makers at all levels to provide timely, accurate, and actionable data to support tactical and strategic planning.

