In this role you will have a fantastic opportunity to shape the data culture of the Product Enablement department. You will play a critical role in enhancing our existing business analytics capabilities, driving data-informed decision making, and improving data practices at the individuals and team level. Ideal candidates are deeply interested in data strategy, have outstanding critical thinking and analytical skills, build strong partnerships, and are deft at bringing initiatives to life.

