This role is part of data science team within Focus Brands. It is a growing team of industry experts working to leverage big data at scale. This position works closely with data engineers and data owners to employs industry best-practices of data governance for effective data quality check and monitoring. Tech stack for this position include SQL and / or Python using Azure Data Studio, Azure Data Factory and Databricks.

