We are looking for a Sr. Healthcare Data Analyst to partner with Clinical, Operations, and Product teams to enhance and scale Vida’s service delivery as we innovate towards a more efficient healthcare system. Vida’s leadership relies on the FP&A team to shape strategy and inform critical business decisions that impact the strategic growth and financial health of the company. In this role, you will need to be a strong problem solver who can bring analytical and thoughtful frameworks to innovate the way healthcare is being delivered, help analyze and structure the service delivery model from end to end, in order to scale operations effectively. You will report directly to the VP of Financial Planning & Analysis.

