• Develop and execute a plan for understanding costs to serve (i.e. healthcare providers, devices, 3rd-party services), projecting what the cost trajectory could look like over time, while proposing scenarios / key dimensions required to move the trajectory in the desirable direction.
• Help surface margin expansion opportunities via efficiency analysis, while balancing qualitative considerations.
• Facilitate alignment of goals and drive clarity around expectations across teams.
• Work with operational stakeholders and Data Science on KPIs and operational metrics, both for executive level (i.e. overall view of the business) and at team / manager level as they depend on FP&A to help drive insights for improving execution.

