We are looking for a Senior Data Analyst to join our remote-based Analytics team and provide expertise to our Telemedicine Operations and Customer Experience (CX) data. You will manage several projects and deadlines, and be an operational data domain expert to liaison between data engineers, business analysts and other stakeholders . You will report to the Senior Manager, Data Analytics and be remote-based.

