• 3+ years experience as an analyst, writing complex queries and visualizing results
• Proficiency using SQL
• Experience using a modern analytics tech stack (Looker, Google BigQuery, DBT)
• Experience logically connecting data and systems logic with business process and requirements
• Experience and comfort with managing simultaneous projects and deadlines
• Experience writing scripts to automate tasks (bash, Python

It Would Be Nice If You Have
• Experience with operations data (fulfillment, contact rates) or healthcare data (HIPPA, PHI)
• Experience with data warehouse schema design and modeling
• Additional Tech Stack: Python, PostgreSQL, Airflow

You'll Get
• An inclusive culture where we are always seeking improvement and cherish your input
• Great compensation package with equity compensation
