23703,893,"Product Data Analyst - Bellevue, WA (HQ) [100% Remote - Anywhere USA]","Chameleon Technologies, Inc.",Anywhere,"• *This is a full-time, direct hire (FTE) role we're looking to fill on behalf of our local client, a software company/ pioneer in lead generation and contact management systems for the real estate industry (headquartered in Bellevue, WA). Salary bands: $115K to $140K (DOE). Resource can be located anywhere in the U.S., as this is a 100% remote role. Hours worked will be leaning mostly toward... Pacific Time Zone, though. So a Pacific Time Zone candidate would be preferred!

