Cox Communications is seeking a Senior Technical Analysis who will report to the Senior Manager, Systems Engineering. This position is involved with the planning, development and execution of integrated, multi-tactical marketing programs. The candidate is a part of the marketing operations team, which is responsible for revenue growth, focused on B2C current and prospective... customers.

