• Bachelor’s degree in a related discipline and 4years’experience in a related field. The right candidate could also have a different combination, such as a master’s degree and 2years’ experience; a Ph.D and up to 1 year of experience; or 8years’ experience in a related field
• Proficiency in Adobe Campaign or similar tools (Unica, Salesforce)
• Adobe Campaign Workflow creation, ACX module (ETL, SFTP and S3 connections)
• Analytical thinker who learns and reacts quickly
• Excellent interpersonal, collaborative and communication skills to work effectively throughout organization

Preferred
