• Identifying, researching, and resolving data anomalies to ensure data quality
• Working with the predictive modeling team to ensure that models are accurate and reflect business reality
• Actively building awareness of analytics at Voya and helping to identify new analytics opportunities
• Evaluating processes and initiatives to measure impact and make appropriate recommendations based on results
• Coaching others in data analysis best practices

Knowledge & Experience
