APFM is the industry leader in senior living referral services in the US; we are a growing company seeking candidates who will help us become an even greater driving force in the field. The Business Intelligence team supports the company in achieving business targets and an improved customer experience by preparing data and insights for use by internal stakeholders. We provide sales, operations, and marketing leaders with a timely and accurate view of the customer journey, enabling them to respond to data insights with informed business decisions.

We are seeking a rock star Senior Analyst who is data driven and enjoys creating new solutions to complex reporting problems. This role will take point on creating dashboards, reports, and data architecture impacting all parts of the business. This individual will use data and insightful analyses to support, inform, and where applicable, challenge decisions to help hone and serve APFM’s business goals. Success in this role will help stakeholders increase conversions from marketing spend to revenue and to contribute to the company’s financial targets.

