Amtrak is seeking a visionary who believes in the relentless use of data, analytics and insights to guide decision making. The Sr. Director, HR Data Analytics will serve as a thought leader, setting and overseeing HR’s digital transformation strategy and efforts to align data systems, technologies, and data use approaches to advance HR’s objectives. The Director will guide the implementation of the strategy and ensure the organization optimizes staff capacity, data systems, and technologies to achieve strategic objectives.

