Knowledge, Skills & Abilities
• High personal motivation, accuracy, detail-orientation and ability to take responsibility in meeting deadlines
• Knowledge and experience of using survey standards and protocols as practiced by major educational rating organizations
• Working well independently yet as part of a team
• Strong mathematical, spoken and written communications skills
• Capacity and willingness to learn new software, research methods, and work routines quickly

