23973,1163,Senior Data Analyst,Yahoo,Anywhere,"It takes powerful technology to connect our brands and partners with an audience of nearly 900 million. Whether you’re looking to write mobile app code, engineer the servers behind our massive ad tech stacks, or develop algorithms to help us process trillions of data points a day, what you do here will have a huge impact on our business—and the world. Want in?

About Us...

What you do in the advertising marketplace will have a huge impact on our business—and the world. It takes powerful technology to connect our brands and partners with an audience of 1 billion. Nearly half of Yahoo employees are building the code and platforms that help us achieve that. At Yahoo, we help people stay informed and entertained, communicate and transact, while creating new ways for advertisers and partners to connect. With technologies like XR, AI, machine-learning, and 5G, we’re transforming media for tomorrow, too. We're creators and coders, dreamers and doers creating what's next in content, advertising and technology.

As a data analyst on the marketplace analytics team, you will be responsible for providing deep analytical insights into the advertising marketplace and drive cross-team issue resolution as it relates to demand, supply, product releases and revenue anomalies.
• In this position, you will:
