• Strong experience with common data science/analytics software tools (e.g. SQL, Hadoop, Spark, Airflow) and cloud computing platforms (e.g. Amazon Web Services, Snowflake).
• Strong experience in data warehousing, dimensional modeling and the ability to bring standard methodologies with regard to data management, ETL, API integrations, and data governance
• Proven ability to sift through data, perform statistical analysis, identify critical information, and develop solution options
• Outstanding written, verbal, and interpersonal communication skills with management, technical peers, and business partners

