• Coordinating with key stakeholders to understand business need, be curious about alternative approaches to improve request/output while delivering impactful outputs WHAT WE’RE LOOKING FOR:
• BS/BA degree in Engineering, Sciences, Finance, Economics or other quantitatively focused subject
