• Five (5) years of experience in healthcare business intelligence and analytics preferred.

Knowledge/Skills/Abilities
• Excellent verbal and written communication skills and the ability to interact professionally with a diverse group of executives, managers, and subject matter experts.
• Experience with quality improvement methodologies, inclusive of concepts like statistical process control; financial/claims-based modeling; economic/actuarial-type insight.
• Excellent problem solving skills, attention to detail and strong analytical skills.
