• Experience with Value Based Care and/or Population Health strongly preferred.
• Cerner EHR, Predictive Analytics experience, strongly preferred.
• Demonstrated experience with data warehouses, data marts and business intelligence solutions (SQL, QlikView, Tableau, PowerBI, Python, R, etc.) strongly preferred.
• Passionate about data and lots of it, and driven by curiosity through creative problem-solving.

