There are various analytics teams that create scores, rankings, and other insights on companies and the industries they compete in.

The Data Governance Analyst II will focus on bringing continuity and comprehensiveness over the documentation, processes, and tools that the various Analytics teams use.

The Data Governance Analyst II will also involve tracking data used in analytics models back to their data sources in order to put proper monitoring and controls in place.

Essential Key Responsibilities/Job Summary
• The Data Governance Analyst II will work with the Enterprise Data Governance team and with the various analytics teams to gather and centralize documentation across different stages of the Analytics model process. The goal is to make sure the library is comprehensive, easy to find, and maintained as Analytics teams conduct yearly reviews.
• The Data Governance Analyst II will build the picture of the various data lineage flows used for each model in order to find areas that need automation and monitoring.
• Work on conformity of processes and tools across the teams so there is a unified and agreed upon method to create models regardless of type.
• Partner with Global Compliance to make sure approvals on models are carried out before any model goes into production.

