Part of XIA is our Digital Feedback team that is focused on tracking our members satisfaction with our digital tools, analyzing the feedback collected and disseminating timely, actionable insights in support of our stakeholders decision making to improve the digital experience.

This position is with Evernorth, a new business within the Cigna Corporation.

