• Self-motivated, strong sense of ownership/accountability, and results oriented with the ability to manage time and schedules effectively
• Demonstrated self-direction and proactive approach and ability to think beyond the immediate problem
• Advanced proficiency in MS Word and Excel as well as proficient understanding of Outlook, and the Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC)
• General knowledge of Business Intelligence tools such as Tableau, PowerBI, Qlik, MicroStrategy, Burst, BusinessObjects, etc
