• Knowledge of enterprise data collection practices
• Understanding of Information management concepts
• General knowledge of databases and SQL
• Ability to understand conceptual data architecture documentation
• Ability to travel as needed to successfully perform position responsibilities; ability to work nights and weekends as needed to successfully accomplish tasks

