24657,1847,Real Time Market Data/Low Latency C++ Software Engineer,Dice,Anywhere,"Dice is the leading career destination for tech experts at every stage of their careers. Our client, Case Interactive, is seeking the following. Apply via Dice today!
• * MULTIPLE POSITIONS OPEN
• Quotes Engineering is an important part of Company's Real Time data offering. Quotes Content team covers over 200 exchanges worldwide and multiple datasets to bring real time quote data to various... Company Applications as well as clients using various data feed products. It powers various crucial applications like charts, time & sales, pricing to name a few.

Some of the challenges involve processing high amount of real time data ( For example a single US options feed line can send more than 150k messages per second ), low latency programming ( creative way to process high volume of data while keeping the latency low ), efficient memory usage when processing large amount of data. Some of the rewards include being the team that powers company's real time offering and drives a lot of design practices within the company.

This exciting group is looking for an software engineer to join it's US team. You will be responsible for driving new developments, maintaining various feeds as well as other supporting infrastructure. Being good at time management and prioritizing various tasks will be key to success during exchange and client driven projects. You will take active role in our cloud migration and be part of the trail blazer in running Market data in the cloud.

Required :
• 3-4 years of experience in industry with a portion in finance industry.
• Market data experience especially on quotes side will be a huge advantage.
• Knowledge of industry standard feed formats like FIX, FAST, SBE
• Proficient in C++ ( CX98 and CX11 onwards )
• Messaging libraries like Zero-MQ or Tibco or Kafka.
• Being able to work and develop on Linux/CentOS.
