25078,334,HR Data Analyst,"America's CAR-MART, Inc.","Rogers, AR","Summary

Successfully evaluates, analyzes and maintains the company HRIS (Human Resource Information System) platform of data. Creates and maintains BI (Business Intelligence) delivered reports for various groups on a consistent basis...

Essential Duties and Responsibilities

Responsible for delivering HR reporting data from UKG (UltiPro)

Responsible for the testing, set-up and implementation of the HRIS system and the on-going development of the HR applications, system administration, support, and maintenance.

