responding to inquiries regarding 835 issues: 3 years (Required)
monitor, troubleshoot, and correct EDI transactions: 3 years (Required)
paid professional healthcare: 2 years (Preferred)
writing and executing SQL Server Management Studio: 2 years (Preferred)

