25311,567,Data Analyst,GrowthDay,United States,"The Opportunity

GrowthDay is looking for a Data Analyst to join our startup Data and Finance team. As a Data Analyst your work will play a key role in the explosive growth at GrowthDay and all of our brand identities. Short-term priorities include capturing and reporting marketing and product data. Long-term projects include cleaning legacy data, automating reports, and evolving our data... organization.

What You Will Do In This Role
