• Maintain and update Marketing Performance reports
• Create new reports to easily convey product information for both B2C and B2B
• Scrub Legacy Data to ensure data integrity
• Audit new data reports being generated to ensure data integrity in data programs

Data you’ll regularly work with:
• Weekly Marketing Campaign Reporting, Financial transaction Data, Google Analytics, Facebook Ad Manager, to create weekly, monthly, and annual reports across multiple departments
• Daily Marketing reporting for Split tests, new Campaign Launches, etc.
• 30/60/90 LTV
• MRR & ARR
• Trialer conversion rate

You Are What We Are Looking For If:
• You have worked in a Principal Data Analyst role in a B2B and B2C SaaS company
• You have 2+ years of experience with Microsoft tools such as Excel, Access ect.
• You’ve spent 2+ years with product analytics tools such as Mixpanel
• You have experience with business intelligence tools: Tableau etc..
• You’ve accumulated 2+ years of experience in portfolio/market management, high-touch marketing tactics, and enterprise pricing analyses
• You’re an excellent data storyteller. You can look at the data given and portray it in easily digestible formats for stakeholders

Bonus if you:
• Have experience with SQL and Java

About GrowthDay

Welcome to GrowthDay! We are the #1 personal development platform in the world, empowering people in 190 countries with the tools, content, coaching, and community to grow and achieve their dreams. Every day, we change people’s lives. We inspire people to shift their mindset, develop healthier habits, achieve their goals faster, and reach for high performance in every area of their life. We do this through our live broadcasts, virtual coaching, online courses, pioneering research, proprietary self-improvement tools, social media initiatives, and industry leadership. Last year, we released our app featuring live weekly training from the world’s best coaches and custom personal growth tools for journaling, online challenges, goal setting, habit scoring, life assessments, and community. To date, we’ve served more clients with research-driven personal development courses, livecasts, one-one-one coaching, and virtual group coaching than any other brand in the world.

Why Work With Us?

For one reason: You feel that it’s part of your calling and purpose to be part of a TEAM that exists to help people change their lives. You want to make a difference and inspire behavior change, in measurable ways, at an extraordinary scale. You want to join a TEAM of hard-working, heart-centered people who believe in the personal power and potential of others. You want to be inspired by the culture of the company you work with every day, and you want to know your work makes a difference. And, you actually LIKE change!

Every Day We Show Up As:
• Deeply Caring - We are friendly, thoughtful, and caring enough to be truthful and compassionate.
• A High-Performance Team - We are selfless and we execute with excellence, caring about the details, and getting it done in a timely manner.
• Role models - Daily we are working on our own growth while being congruent, self-disciplined, humble, and a positive influence to others.
• Candid Communicators - We are honest and respectful in all facets of communication, embracing feedback, and we share information openly and proactively.
• Creative Thinkers - We continuously live outside the box, thinking about the look and feel, and the interconnections between everything.
• Driven - We show up every day, taking action vs getting stuck or avoiding, and embrace hard work with a smile.
• Passionate Advocates For Our Customers' Growth and Experience - The fundamental reason GrowthDay exists. It is our purpose",2022-01-21,Full-time,data analyst,United States,"['tableau', 'sql', 'excel', 'java']"
