26805,2061,Lead Data Steward - Corporate IT (Kansas City),Burns & McDonnell,"Kansas City, MO","A successful data organization is critical to meeting our Burns & McDonnell goals. A Lead Data Steward focuses on establishing accountability for the data produced and ultimately consumed, unlocking its value, and empowering a customer-focused business. This individual will drive data trust through accuracy, completeness, and consistency of data and check whether our data adheres to access and... confidentiality expectations.

