• Self-starter with great curiosity about technology and behavior
• Stellar written and communication skills
• Experience managing projects end-to-end, including task definition, work estimation, and status reporting
• Clear, effective verbal and written communication skills including the ability to actively listen, problem solve, and communicate across technical and business teams
