27433,627,"(USA) 2023 Summer Intern: Data Analyst, Data Ventures",Walmart,"Lowell, AR","Position Summary...

What you'll do...

About Data Ventures:
The Walmart Data Ventures team exists to unlock the full value of Walmart's data by developing andproductizingB2B datainitiativesthat empower merchants and suppliers to make better, faster decisions for the business. As part of this transformation, we're seeking entrepreneurial individuals to help drive data productization from concept to deployment.
Responsibilities:
• Partnering with business and product stakeholders to solve challenging business problems and identify trends and opportunities
• Identifying and monitoring security profiling and providing solutions to product, account, and customers
• Identifying new levers to help improve key financial data insights, understanding root causes for change in metrics
• Conducting exploratory data analysis including hypothesis testing, statistical inference, and statistical analysis

Desired Majors: Business, Computer Science/Engineering, Information Technology, Project/Program Management, Communications

