27971,1165,Data Analyst III (Healthcare Analytics),Corporate,"Kansas City, MO","You could be the one who changes everything for our 26 million members. Centene is transforming the health of our communities, one person at a time. As a diversified, national organization, you'll have access to competitive benefits including a fresh perspective on workplace flexibility.

