• Leverage areas of expertise to improve the effectiveness and quality of Metas support of developers and users
• Build cross-functional relationships with Operations leaders, Data Scientists, Product Managers and Software Engineers to understand data needs and deliver on those needs
• Telecommute from anywhere in the U.S. permitted (remote work benefit)

