• Statistics and experimentation: Applied A/B testing, time series analysis, stochastic modeling, and survival analysis, in an industry setting
• Machine learning and quantitative analysis techniques: Applied Regression, Classification, Clustering, Decision Tree, Random Forest, Neural Network, pattern recognition, descriptive, inferential statistics, and Support Vector Machine, to business problems
• Data and information visualization technique including Tableau, Unidash, and QlikView
• Communicating the results of analyses to product teams, engineer teams, and leadership teams to influence strategy",2022-12-15,Full-time,data analyst,United States,"['tableau', 'sql', 'dplyr', 'pandas', 'scikit-learn', 'python', 'numpy']"
