28048,1242,DATA ANALYST w/INFORMATICA EXPERIENCE,Business Advisory Solutions Group (BASG),United States,"Business Advisory Solutions Group (BASG) is seeking candidates for a Data Analyst / Business Analyst with Informatica experience . And, yes, Informatica is 100% required . This staff position will be essentially remote with some in-office work or travel on occasion.

The Data/Business Analyst selected will work with a Team developing a Data Governance Program within a financial services... organization. He/she will gather data requirements from LOBs to determine current and future state data needs and help to create reporting solutions. The goal is to ensure the integrity and quality of the data and the successful mining of that data to benefit the organization.

Experience Requirements include:
5 years of experience as a Data or Business Analyst
Informatica is required; experience working on an Informatica implementation preferred
