Ability to create reporting solutions with minimal guidance from manager Ability to work within a fast paced environment that requires balancing priorities with multiple internal and external customers/business units Ability to present complex data to internal and external business leadership teams Ability to lead procurement projects Affinity with procurement processes) Experience in working with IT systems and databases Project management experience Technical Required Skills: SAP reporting SAC analytics LX systems knowledge Advanced Excel Skills Intermediate PowerPoint Skills Database experience (SQL)

