28239,1433,Business/Data Analyst,TEKsystems,"Kansas City, MO","Description:

TEKsystems is looking for an IT Business Analyst to join our team and help with implementing a new Policy Admin System (Duck Creek) to replace the current system. As part of this implementation, we will be adding 2 BA's and 1 BDA to the project team. These resources will be part of an over-arching program supporting the replacement effort. Ideally, this person will have Commercial... Line and Worker's Comp experience. It would also be beneficial if they had Duck Creek and/or billing background . This resource will be more focused around the underlying API's, XML, etc. stories/requirements.

This person must have a strong Agile background ; the team works in 2-week sprints and use Jira and Confluence. We are leveraging an SI to do a lot of the heavy lifting. There are a total of 12 workstreams for the overall effort. The project is at Sprint 0 and is estimated for 8 weeks to get things kicked off and to stay ahead of things. This person will need to get in quickly and establish credibility quickly - understanding the data and how it's mapped will also be important. This person needs to be a technical analyst that has data and integration experience coupled with the ability to drive requirements.

Contract Length:

12 months, although the project is slated to take roughly 2 years

Top Skills Details:

Business analysis, Data analysis, DAISS, Agile, Requirements Gathering, Microservices, API's, XML

Additional Information:

Most of the technical team sits in Kansas City; the candidate can sit remote. About TEKsystems:

We're partners in transformation. We help clients activate ideas and solutions to take advantage of a new world of opportunity. We are a team of 80,000 strong, working with over 6,000 clients, including 80% of the Fortune 500, across North America, Europe and Asia. As an industry leader in Full-Stack Technology Services, Talent Services, and real-world application, we work with progressive leaders to drive change. That's the power of true partnership. TEKsystems is an Allegis Group company.

