• Support system and data initiatives in product launches
• Support the development of tools, dashboards, reporting and process improvements.
• Facilitate data reconciliation / data validation.
• Execute all work in an appropriate and compliant manner consistent with the values of the organization, working with internal teams to define and revise procedures and policies as needed.
