• Bachelor's degree in Life Science, Data Science and/or Business / Marketing
6 - 9 Years of Experience
• Experience in analytics and reporting
• Proficiency with Excel and PowerPoint
• Skilled at project management.
• Expertise in analytical tools such as SQL, QLIK, Tableau
• Experience in advanced analytics in healthcare, research /consulting, or pharmaceutical/biotech company
• Deep knowledge of data manipulation, harmonization and integration for analytics purposes
• Experience with external data such as claims data, EMR and 3rd party practitioner data
• Experience in supporting dashboard design / development / testing
• Ability to root out data quality concerns and drive resolution
• Excellent communication skills
• Ability to work independently and communicate with stakeholders
• Ability to work with complex datasets an synthesize data to address business needs
• Fluency in English, both written and oral, are mandatory requirements
• Experience with specialty and/or orphan/rare disease therapies.
• Proven experience with CRM, alignment and analytical applications
• Expertise with MDM
• Statistical, regression and other analytics skills
